Date: Sun, 19 Apr 2026 15:23:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] board: freescale: gateway-dk: add board core

Adds the Mono Gateway Development Kit board directory with its Kconfig
entry, build glue, README, MAINTAINERS, board init, DDR setup, and
ethernet plumbing. The hardware is an LS1046A SoC with both QSPI and
eMMC boot paths.

Subsequent patches add the per-component self-tests, defconfig, device
tree, and the upstream-side hooks that wire this board into the build.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [product-specific]

Signed-off-by: Tomaz Zaman <tomaz@mono.si>
